{"speciesId":421,"names":{"fr":"Ceriflor","es":"Cherrim","en":"Cherrim","ja":"チェリム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It blooms during times of strong sunlight. It tries to make up for everything it endured as a bud."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is docile as a bud, but turns cheerful when it blooms. It folds back into a bud if sunlight wanes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sous un grand soleil, il ouvre ses pétales pour en absorber les rayons."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sous un grand soleil, il ouvre ses pétales pour en absorber les rayons."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Une fois gorgé de soleil, il déploie ses pétales et bouge avec vivacité."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando los rayos de sol inundan su capullo, abre de par en par sus pétalos y se vuelve muy dinámico."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"つぼみが 太陽の 光を 浴びて 花びらを 広げると 活発に 動くように なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sous un grand soleil, il ouvre ses pétales pour en absorber les rayons."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando detecta luz solar fuerte, despliega los pétalos y absorbe todos los rayos posibles."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"強い 日差しを 感じとると 閉ざしていた 花びらを 広げ 全身で 日光を 浴びる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Une fois gorgé de soleil, il déploie ses pétales et bouge avec vivacité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando los rayos de sol inundan su capullo, abre de par en par sus pétalos y se vuelve muy dinámico."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"つぼみが 太陽の 光を 浴びて 花びらを 広げると 活発に 動くように なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sous un grand soleil, il ouvre ses pétales pour en absorber les rayons."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando detecta luz solar fuerte, despliega los pétalos y absorbe todos los rayos posibles."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"強い 日差しを 感じとると 閉ざしていた 花びらを 広げ 全身で 日光を 浴びる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Pendant sa période de bourgeonnement, il reste presque totalement immobile et attend que le soleil se lève."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Permanece casi inmóvil cerrado en un capullo a la espera de que lo bañen los rayos del sol."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"As a 